  "description": "BIZANGO\n\nInheriting an award winning pedigree, the current generation of the Bizango Mountain Bike adopts a modern geometry with dropped chainstays for generous tire clearance, a slacker head angle for confident inspiring downhill, and a steeper seat angle for more efficient pedaling dynamics. Moreover, the frame features inner cable routing for dropper posts, giving you the option to make your bike even a faster descender.\n\nA quality and reliable frame must be accompanied by quality and reliable components. For Bizango, we have chosen Shimano Deore drivetrain with a wide range cassette with gears for any kind of terrain. Paired with Shimano hydraulic disc brakes, SR Suntour air fork, tubeless ready wheels, and a set of Voodoo Alloy components, you’ll have control and comfort to enjoy your incursions into the wonders of the world.\n\nRide a Bizango and be part of a family of bikes with decades old roots.\n\nA historic bike to write your own history.",
